From: lancethepants <lancethepants@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: phy: motorcomm: include of.h for the YT8824 package probe

OpenWrt 25.12.6 switched motorcomm.c to the device_property API and dropped
<linux/of.h>, but GL's YT8824 support (999-4522) still reads
"motorcomm,interface-mode" from the PHY package's device_node with
of_property_read_string(). Restore the include.

---
--- a/drivers/net/phy/motorcomm.c
+++ b/drivers/net/phy/motorcomm.c
@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@
 #include <linux/etherdevice.h>
 #include <linux/kernel.h>
 #include <linux/module.h>
+#include <linux/of.h>
 #include <linux/phy.h>
 #include <linux/property.h>
 
